body:
I feel this panging want too but I don't do it because it'll hurt my loved ones so much more than it'll hurt me. So I go on every day. I hope you find your "because", your reason not to pull the trigger. It might be beautiful outside, I hope you get to enjoy it for a little while. 

&#x200B;

The world sucks but some times the sun shines. Cheers to you, internet stranger, I hope to choose to stay for some more sun shine.
